msgid "PDF"
msgstr "PDF"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "The companies' places as a GeoJSON file, out, and points read in that place a company's address by hand once you have ticked them. It needs Maps. Switched off, neither is offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "Il-postijiet tal-kumpaniji bħala fajl GeoJSON, 'il barra, u punti li jinqraw li jpoġġu l-indirizz ta' kumpanija bl-idejn ladarba tkun immarkajthom. Jeħtieġ Maps. Meta jkun mitfi, l-ebda wieħed ma jiġi offrut u l-indirizzi tagħhom iwieġbu daqslikieku ma hemm xejn."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "The file formats Postulo can read and write besides its own: PDF, Word, OpenDocument, iCalendar, vCard and Europass. This is the switch for all of them at once; each can still be switched off on its own while this is on, and PDF cannot be. Switched off, nothing is offered in those formats and nothing is deleted: the files you have, and the data they were made from, stay."
msgstr "Il-formati tal-fajls li Postulo jista' jaqra u jikteb minbarra tiegħu: PDF, Word, OpenDocument, iCalendar, vCard u Europass. Dan hu s-swiċċ għal kollha f'daqqa; kull wieħed xorta jista' jintefa waħdu waqt li dan ikun mixgħul, ħlief PDF. Meta jkun mitfi, xejn ma jiġi offrut f'dawk il-formati u xejn ma jitħassar: il-fajls li għandek, u d-data li minnha saru, jibqgħu."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "The format a CV and a letter are made in: tagged, so a screen reader can read it. Always on; Postulo has nothing else that would still be a CV."
msgstr "Il-format li fih isiru CV u ittra: ittaggjat, biex qarrej tal-iskrin ikun jista' jaqrah. Dejjem mixgħul; Postulo m'għandu xejn ieħor li jkun għadu CV."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "vCard"
msgstr "vCard"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Word documents: a CV or a letter downloaded as a .docx file, and the text of a .docx you upload kept so that a search can find it. Switched off, the download is not offered and an uploaded file's text is not read."
msgstr "Dokumenti Word: CV jew ittra mniżżla bħala fajl .docx, u t-test ta' .docx li ttella' miżmum biex tfittxija tkun tista' ssibu. Meta jkun mitfi, id-download ma jiġix offrut u t-test ta' fajl imtella' ma jinqarax."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Your calendar as .ics files and feeds, and a calendar file read in. Switched off, the downloads, the import and the feeds are not offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there; they answer again, at the same address, when it is switched on."
msgstr "Il-kalendarju tiegħek bħala fajls u feeds .ics, u fajl tal-kalendarju li jinqara. Meta jkun mitfi, id-downloads, l-importazzjoni u l-feeds ma jiġux offruti u l-indirizzi tagħhom iwieġbu daqslikieku ma hemm xejn; jerġgħu jwieġbu, fl-istess indirizz, meta jinxtegħel."
